    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ECHOING SILENCE</strong><br><i>A tense, atmospheric survival experience.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore an isolated cave system in first-person, where you'll manage your supplies, document what you find, and fight to stay sane as the silence and darkness slowly close in.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No map. No help. Just you\u2026 the echo\u2026 and a forgotten story waiting to be uncovered \u2014 if you survive long enough.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every moment demands caution \u2014 true cave exploration is slow, careful, and deliberate. The constant disorientation turns the simple act of navigation into a true test of survival and mental resilience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The unstable, treacherous terrain makes every step a tense, deliberate choice \u2014 where a single mistake could mean the end.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore. Observe. Survive.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151230/extras/965cfca02ab1133638029333149195cc.poster.avif?t=1754427286\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151230/extras/965cfca02ab1133638029333149195cc.webm?t=1754427286\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151230/extras/965cfca02ab1133638029333149195cc.mp4?t=1754427286\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore the silence and the darkness</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A vast underground maze, where silence and darkness are your only companions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some secrets buried here were never meant to be found.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your path will define your fate \u2014 a great discovery\u2026 or being lost forever.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151230/extras/65bfe13c531e77e42ddeb7a7970dabfd.poster.avif?t=1754427286\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151230/extras/65bfe13c531e77e42ddeb7a7970dabfd.webm?t=1754427286\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151230/extras/65bfe13c531e77e42ddeb7a7970dabfd.mp4?t=1754427286\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Survive the isolation</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hunger, thirst, and exhaustion are always against you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mind may hold\u2026 or it may break.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The real danger might not lie ahead \u2014 but all around you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151230/extras/fad3ed5d96ecafb4fb5d14ced6dbbf3b.poster.avif?t=1754427286\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151230/extras/fad3ed5d96ecafb4fb5d14ced6dbbf3b.webm?t=1754427286\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151230/extras/fad3ed5d96ecafb4fb5d14ced6dbbf3b.mp4?t=1754427286\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Light is your ally\u2026 but for how long?</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use flashlights, lanterns, and glowsticks wisely.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not every shadow is empty.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And when the light goes out, only your footsteps will remain.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add <strong>Echoing Silence</strong> to your wishlist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Do you have the courage to face the darkness\u2026 and the silence?</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ECHOING SILENCE</strong><br><i>A tense, atmospheric survival experience.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore an isolated cave system in first-person, where you'll manage your supplies, document what you find, and fight to stay sane as the silence and darkness slowly close in.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No map. No help. Just you\u2026 the echo\u2026 and a forgotten story waiting to be uncovered \u2014 if you survive long enough.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every moment demands caution \u2014 true cave exploration is slow, careful, and deliberate. The constant disorientation turns the simple act of navigation into a true test of survival and mental resilience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The unstable, treacherous terrain makes every step a tense, deliberate choice \u2014 where a single mistake could mean the end.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore. Observe. Survive.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151230/extras/965cfca02ab1133638029333149195cc.poster.avif?t=1754427286\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151230/extras/965cfca02ab1133638029333149195cc.webm?t=1754427286\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151230/extras/965cfca02ab1133638029333149195cc.mp4?t=1754427286\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore the silence and the darkness</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A vast underground maze, where silence and darkness are your only companions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some secrets buried here were never meant to be found.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your path will define your fate \u2014 a great discovery\u2026 or being lost forever.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151230/extras/65bfe13c531e77e42ddeb7a7970dabfd.poster.avif?t=1754427286\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151230/extras/65bfe13c531e77e42ddeb7a7970dabfd.webm?t=1754427286\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151230/extras/65bfe13c531e77e42ddeb7a7970dabfd.mp4?t=1754427286\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Survive the isolation</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hunger, thirst, and exhaustion are always against you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mind may hold\u2026 or it may break.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The real danger might not lie ahead \u2014 but all around you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151230/extras/fad3ed5d96ecafb4fb5d14ced6dbbf3b.poster.avif?t=1754427286\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151230/extras/fad3ed5d96ecafb4fb5d14ced6dbbf3b.webm?t=1754427286\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151230/extras/fad3ed5d96ecafb4fb5d14ced6dbbf3b.mp4?t=1754427286\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Light is your ally\u2026 but for how long?</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use flashlights, lanterns, and glowsticks wisely.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not every shadow is empty.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And when the light goes out, only your footsteps will remain.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add <strong>Echoing Silence</strong> to your wishlist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Do you have the courage to face the darkness\u2026 and the silence?</strong></p>",
